{"title":"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-tuples of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f14a136a8f5b219d6ba57100fafc0c979336d44d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d,e,f,g)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" /> that satisfy the following systems of equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73294e36f204a2f90e372ee7c1cab577db2e590.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} abc&amp;=70,\\\\ cde&amp;=71,\\\\ efg&amp;=72. \\end{align*}\" width=\"74\" height=\"66\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d876785ca5cd7c5e86b06f542b1f94ed36ffc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\mid 70, 71 \\implies c \\mid \\text{gcd} (70, 71) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"259\" height=\"20\" /> which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7ce46690101dc115651decd6ff241a518a44609.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5cf755f6aa7eff5ce3a3b89a1334ef6e4e336c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />. Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34b58cf8ff9b8d943304e78f1eb10d2dce8378ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau (70) = 8, \\tau(72) = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" /> (where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/c/1dc1c0119a604b91be9142370dc3159b6a9bbcb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau$\" width=\"9\" height=\"8\" /> is the divisor function), so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a50cdaf40d53aa04bede5f5435182af3022082f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f, g)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />. This gives us a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/5/315580adb0628bee61b823f1f782e8942cf54552.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\cdot 12 = \\boxed{096}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" /> solutions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that any two consecutive numbers are coprime. Using this, we can figure out that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7ce46690101dc115651decd6ff241a518a44609.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> then has to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Now we have two equations left. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/8/6789a96adb2d14a8b6153a0a98644ffe7ea8f4d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=70$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/2/af2e56e4c6867d8a3a7d33f4acd32a907e1ba89f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$fg=72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />. To solve these we just need to figure out all of the factors. Doing the prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, we find that they have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> factors, respectively. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14fc1844f7e0c8ead21e89fcb01cd5323542a221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 12=\\boxed{096}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~kempwood\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/5171ee76624322caa2d9d612a8eb2d7368ccaccd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c|70,71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/1/7c140afd8265405154b7714b0d4a911d6569c8cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(70,71)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. By similar logic, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7ce46690101dc115651decd6ff241a518a44609.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bcd1c2d47eeb88830f8f7e2fa5b72c7fee0fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=e=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />, the number of solutions is the number of factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> multiplied by the number of factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/beb344fbb5d4c1037601bae293db2201c67d3aa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70=2^1 \\times 5^1 \\times7^1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f00a6c569d078b6b36176fc4b2fc620d45234c70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+1)^3=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" /> factors. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcf370b7151cdfcaa504657258236936f232a22f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72=2^3 \\times 3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/a/83a81cf54fecf6d87af4837ad8ea5bd6e98f84f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3+1)\\times(2+1)=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" /> factors. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" /> Thus, the final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d8655e21eabde14bd0afdd9808650b6b62cb2d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\times12=\\boxed{96}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" /> ~pandapower24\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II\" title=\"2019 AIME II\">2019 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2019\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017175212\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 281/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7091/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.619      1 -total\n 57.53%    7.260      1 Template:AIME_box\n 40.69%    5.135      1 Template